{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "测试与参考的基因交集必须非空；若两者使用不同基因注释命名空间（如 HGNC 符号与 Ensembl ID），可能直接导致交集为空并报错。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "If this intersection is empty (e.g., because the two datasets use different gene annotations), an error will be raised."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "参考矩阵要求行名为基因名，且表达值通常应为归一化并 log 转换后的值。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Each row should be named with the gene name. In general, the expression values are expected to be normalized and log-transformed, see Details."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "测试输入应为基因×细胞表达矩阵，或携带该矩阵的 SummarizedExperiment 容器。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "A numeric matrix of single-cell expression values where rows are genes and columns are cells. Alternatively, a SummarizedExperiment object containing such a matrix."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：测试表达不要求 log 转换，因为 SingleR 只使用秩；原始 UMI 计数或转录计数也可直接使用，但这属于可检测性说明，不代表已确认你的数据满足该条件。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "In practice, the raw counts (for UMI data) or the transcript counts (for read count data) can also be used without normalization and log-transformation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：参考数据需要实际可用的带注释参考表达数据；论文中列出的参考资源只是示例，不能仅凭引用就假定已获得可用的参考数据文件。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "SingleR can be used with any reference data set. For mouse samples, we used the ImmGen database..."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "clarifying_question": "测试数据的 Ensembl stable IDs 与参考的 HGNC symbols 是否已提供映射表，或是否已统一为同一命名空间？"
}
